<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Oil In Somalia Italy v India, 1990</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Historical Background&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Italian Somaliland was an Italian colony and in later years the Trust Territory of Somalia until 1960 when Somalia was granted independence. &lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;During this period Italians made up a significant proportion of the population.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: Alegreya-Regular"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Somalia’s history of oil exploration dates back several decades. During colonialism, Italian and British geologists were the first to identify oil seeps. Starting in the early 1950s, Italy-based Agip (now Eni) and US-based Sinclair Oil Corporation began to study the petroleum geology of Somalia. This was followed by another major phase of hydrocarbon exploration in the late 1980s, spearheaded by ConocoPhillips, Shell (Pectin), Eni, Amoco, Total and Texaco. (Oil In&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Somalia – Adding Fuel to the Fire?, Dominik Balthasar)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Scenario Background&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In an attempt to stabilise his government the Barre regime has granted oil exploration rights to ENI oil and allowed basing of our troops and aircraft in northern Somalia. However, the civil war has escalated and the nation is in a state of chaos, the civil government close to complete collapse&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Nine Days ago the Indian air force dropped troops provide ‘humanitarian aid’ to the small port town of Eyl. It is clear the Indians are establishing a foothold attempting land grabs and expansion of an Indian controlled Indian Ocean.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Oman, historically a strong ally of India, has allowed refuelling of Indian aircraft transiting through to the small airfield at Eyl.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The Marines of the San Marco regiment have been loaded onto the LPD’s San Giorgio and San Marco and are tasked to land at Eyl and re-establish control of the airfield and expel the Indian troops.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;All Indian forces are to be considered Hostile&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Designers Notes&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Most Airfields in Somalia were very underdeveloped and lack infrastructure, the number of aircraft that can be based on them is very small.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The Italian Harriers were not available in 1990.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
